Steps:
[AUTH] Obtain an admin Bearer token via POST {{BACK_URL}}/connect/token (user {{ADMIN}}, password from the environment, never typed in the case)
[HTTP] POST {{BACK_URL}}/api/page-builder-pages/create-group-page {name:"AGENT-TEST-VCST4935-<unique>-xx", permalink:"/agent-test-vcst4935-<unique>-xx", cultureName:"xx-XX", storeId:"{{STORE_ID}}", visibility:true}; capture XX_ID
[HTTP] Create a root (default en-US, permalink /agent-test-vcst4935-<unique>-lnk) with an en-US version; capture ROOT_ID
[HTTP] POST {{BACK_URL}}/api/page-builder-multilanguage-pages/convert/{XX_ID}
[STATUS] Read the status and message
[HTTP] POST {{BACK_URL}}/api/page-builder-multilanguage-pages/{ROOT_ID}/link/{XX_ID}
[STATUS] Read the status and message
[HTTP] GET .../{ROOT_ID}/languages and GET .../grouped/{XX_ID}
